WEBVTT

00:00:13.345 --> 00:00:14.420
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Hello, Reception.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.254
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Hello, this is room thirteen.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.180
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> How can I help you?

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.740
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> There’s a problem with the air conditioning.

00:00:40.991 --> 00:00:43.940
It isn’t working and it’s very hot in my room.

00:00:56.587 --> 00:00:57.238
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> I’m sorry.

00:00:57.238 --> 00:00:59.740
I’ll send somebody up to look at it right now.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:09.940
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v>  Good morning, Reception.

00:01:10.311 --> 00:01:13.302
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Hello. I’m sorry to bother you again.

00:01:20.369 --> 00:01:21.936
This is room thirteen.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.272
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v>  How can I help?

00:01:31.115 --> 00:01:32.580
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> I have another problem.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.420
I can’t connect to the Wi-Fi.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:49.740
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> I’m sorry.

00:01:50.084 --> 00:01:52.040
I’ll put you through to my colleague.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.420
She can help you.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.340
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Thank you very much.